cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "In The Eyes Of"
abstract: "An offline-first system for geolocalized expert narration in heritage interpretation. An expert wearing egocentric capture glasses walks a site once while narrating; an authoring-time pipeline analyzes speech and gaze to build a geolocalized knowledge graph of the site; the resulting experience is served to visitors entirely offline from a battery-powered on-site node."
